start notice-filed

state notice-filed: "Notice of appeal filed" by applicant cite ?("Mo. Sup. Ct. R. 81.04")
{
  note "OUTLINE. Missouri Court of Appeals, Southern District: the district's local rules and special rules (verify) supplement the statewide rules. Notice of appeal under Rule 81.04; period is a hole (verify)."
