  }
}

decision appealability: "Appellate jurisdiction check" by court cite ?("Mo. Const. art. V, § 3; Mo. Sup. Ct. R. 81.04 (verify)")
{
  note "OUTLINE. Final judgment and appealable orders (verify). Nazeri v. Missouri Valley College, 860 S.W.2d 303 (Mo. banc 1993) is pleading only."
